#: templates/rankings.html:105
msgid "按同一部作品在各分类榜的合计在榜周数排序，只守着一个分类榜的书也一并计入。口径是当前在榜的累计周数，不是本年度累计；真正的年度榜要等每周榜单快照积累若干周之后才能给出。"
msgstr "Ranked by the combined weeks each work has spent on the lists, including books that hold a single list. This counts weeks on the current run, not weeks within a calendar year; a true year-to-date list needs the weekly snapshots to accumulate first."

